{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026sFK60qiYud1794498511.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>孫中山紀念館舉行專題展覽，紀念孫中山誕辰160周年。</p><p></p><p>共展出逾180件孫中山歷史圖片與文物，呈現他一生不同的形象，希望緬懷和發揚孫中山的革命精神。其中包括孫中山在1897年撰寫的《倫敦蒙難記》，就是他的肖像首次出現。還首次展出1928年由瑞士製造，琺瑯表面燒有孫中山肖像的紀念懷表，以及於1947年印刷的伍百元關金券等。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SUN.MUSEUM-2300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026uxlD5090281794498518.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>展期由即日起開放至明年7月7日，公眾可免費入場參觀。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T16:24:26.765506+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":187,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T15:28:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T12:14:31.646846+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T16:17:40.777167+00:00","content_hash":"01233679269001567eb36eb56744fcfd9831773f02b2aeba4a08f0167e9d8c19","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T16:24:26.765506+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}